<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Buffels Q2 pre-capex net profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Buffels Q2 pre-capex net profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending 4.81  vs 11.85</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 20.26 vs 2.38 recoupment</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			1,251  vs 1,586</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	     230,000  vs 233,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			   5.44  vs 6.81</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			 61,407  vs 44,898</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		    48,739  vs 52,017</p>
<p>Full name: Buffelsfontein Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
